<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:34,990 --> 00:01:36,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

26
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:48,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pretty impressive...</font>

27
00:01:49,170 --> 00:01:53,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You timed it well to scatter
the three to attack.</font>

28
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:55,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must have practiced quite a bit, huh?</font>

29
00:01:57,340 --> 00:01:59,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since it is a pretty complicated song...</font>

30
00:02:00,890 --> 00:02:02,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

31
00:02:03,180 --> 00:02:05,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only did you
immediately understand</font>

32
00:02:05,140 --> 00:02:07,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that I'm manipulating
these guys with my flute,</font>

33
00:02:07,850 --> 00:02:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but you understood
how difficult this song is.</font>

34
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a pretty impressive punk.</font>

35
00:02:13,150 --> 00:02:16,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you can't completely
understand this song.</font>

36
00:02:17,570 --> 00:02:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True... Since art is so foreign to me.</font>

37
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:27,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But since she uses that flute
to manipulate,</font>

38
00:02:27,710 --> 00:02:31,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it means that song must contain
individually specific sound patterns</font>

39
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:35,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to control each and every movement
of those guys...</font>

40
00:02:36,340 --> 00:02:39,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm pretty confident when it comes
to just analyzing</font>

41
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:41,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but this time it's not looking good.</font>

42
00:02:43,810 --> 00:02:45,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason is...</font>

43
00:02:45,470 --> 00:02:48,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't understand
musical notes whatsoever.</font>

44
00:02:49,140 --> 00:02:55,110
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Fake!</font>

45
00:02:49,140 --> 00:02:55,110
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Man Shikamaru</font>

46
00:02:49,140 --> 00:02:55,110
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Gambles</font>

47
00:02:49,140 --> 00:02:55,110
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">to Recover From a</font>

48
00:02:49,140 --> 00:02:55,110
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Hopeless Situation</font>

49
00:02:49,140 --> 00:02:55,110
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"></font>

50
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll specially show you
the Camellia Dance next.</font>

51
00:03:06,410 --> 00:03:07,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll crush you!</font>

52
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:13,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shouldn't say things
you can't even do.</font>

53
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:15,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

54
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

55
00:03:34,980 --> 00:03:35,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you.</font>

56
00:03:36,820 --> 00:03:39,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This bone is harder than steel.</font>

57
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:46,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should have a taste of it
with your own body.</font>

58
00:04:19,730 --> 00:04:20,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

59
00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:35,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no one that's heard
this song and lived.</font>

60
00:04:42,170 --> 00:04:46,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Finale Ninth Passage
Demon Revolution!</font>

61
00:05:01,070 --> 00:05:02,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The melody's changed!</font>

62
00:05:05,530 --> 00:05:07,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something's gonna come!</font>

63
00:05:21,130 --> 00:05:22,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

64
00:05:36,890 --> 00:05:37,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

65
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:49,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...?</font>

66
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:59,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The speed at which he flees
after determining</font>

67
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that these Material Ghosts
are dangerous...</font>

68
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pretty impressive.</font>

69
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:05,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

70
00:06:15,100 --> 00:06:18,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've used my precious Paper Bombs
and Smoke Bombs all at once</font>

71
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:20,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and all I could do was hide.</font>

72
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That white one...</font>

73
00:06:24,730 --> 00:06:27,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">bit off my physical energy.</font>

74
00:06:33,870 --> 00:06:36,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seeing that shuriken passed through</font>

75
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:39,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that thing is semi-materialistic
with very little mass.</font>

76
00:06:40,210 --> 00:06:42,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Chakra itself with an appetite.</font>

77
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's probably Chakra that's shaped
mostly by mental energy.</font>

78
00:06:48,550 --> 00:06:52,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why it seeks stability
and craves for physical energy.</font>

79
00:06:53,220 --> 00:06:56,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I continue dealing with
those "Hungry Chakra"</font>

80
00:06:56,270 --> 00:06:57,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be able to build up my Chakra.</font>

81
00:06:58,940 --> 00:07:00,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're pretty dangerous.</font>

82
00:07:02,230 --> 00:07:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's a Shinobi who can
make special Chakra like me...</font>

83
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's without a doubt a Secret Ninjutsu.</font>

84
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:12,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which means I should leave
the white thing alone</font>

85
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:14,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and aim for the main body!</font>

86
00:07:15,490 --> 00:07:19,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The quickest way would be
to stop the sound of the flute but...</font>

87
00:07:20,250 --> 00:07:24,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it'd be impossible to get close to
that woman in this situation.</font>

88
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:31,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The next thing would be to capture
those three with Shadow Possession Jutsu.</font>

89
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:36,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that's difficult too since they're
attacking me separately at different times.</font>

90
00:07:37,430 --> 00:07:42,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I let even one escape
I'd be attacked and it'd be the end...</font>

91
00:07:43,350 --> 00:07:46,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There aren't any openings in
either offense or defense, this woman...</font>

92
00:07:47,860 --> 00:07:50,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! She might be
a pretty good Shogi player.</font>

93
00:07:53,860 --> 00:07:56,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My remaining Ninja tools
are twelve kunai knives,</font>

94
00:07:56,240 --> 00:08:01,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">nine shuriken, twelve meters of wire,
one Flash Bomb, and one Paper Bomb...</font>

95
00:08:03,580 --> 00:08:05,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man...</font>

96
00:08:05,580 --> 00:08:08,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel like I'm playing without
rooks or bishops.</font>

97
00:08:27,730 --> 00:08:28,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did I lose them?</font>

98
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess that's not possible...</font>

99
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru?</font>

100
00:08:41,410 --> 00:08:43,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here. Eat this, Akamaru.</font>

101
00:08:43,790 --> 00:08:45,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't eat you won't
get your strength back.</font>

102
00:08:54,430 --> 00:08:57,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right. Akamaru, let's go!</font>

103
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:59,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's the issue of those guys too...</font>

104
00:09:04,850 --> 00:09:06,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dance of the Camellia!</font>

105
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:42,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no use hiding.</font>

106
00:09:44,020 --> 00:09:46,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unless you can predict
these guys' movements</font>

107
00:09:46,850 --> 00:09:48,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's nowhere you can run, little rat.</font>

108
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:51,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll find you and break you
into pieces right away!</font>

109
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then...</font>

110
00:10:06,710 --> 00:10:10,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right. Everything's ready.
All that remains is to do it.</font>

111
00:10:12,710 --> 00:10:14,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There'll be nine attacks.</font>

112
00:10:14,460 --> 00:10:16,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The outcome will be decided
during the attacks.</font>

113
00:10:20,390 --> 00:10:21,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One!</font>

114
00:10:24,930 --> 00:10:26,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One!</font>

115
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:42,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wishful thinking!</font>

116
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:44,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Jutsu manipulated by
this sound is invincible.</font>

117
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:48,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever plans you have
to win against me... is useless!</font>

118
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:09,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two!</font>

119
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scampering around you little rat!
Where are you?!</font>

120
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:21,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three!</font>

121
00:11:27,870 --> 00:11:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're over there!</font>

122
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:44,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Four!</font>

123
00:11:49,310 --> 00:11:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's a cheap trick.
You think you can make a fool of me?!</font>

124
00:11:56,730 --> 00:11:58,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five... six...</font>

125
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">seven... eight...</font>

126
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:19,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scurrying around to get away.
What is he thinking?</font>

127
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:33,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Light?!</font>

128
00:12:33,770 --> 00:12:34,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nine!</font>

129
00:12:34,650 --> 00:12:35,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

130
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:38,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's lengthened the shadows
with light and...</font>

131
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:40,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu!</font>

132
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:45,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu...
a success!</font>

133
00:12:45,570 --> 00:12:46,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's impossible...</font>

134
00:12:47,780 --> 00:12:50,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How were you able to predict
these guys' movements?!</font>

135
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:54,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way you could have heard
the differences in my music patterns!</font>

136
00:12:57,210 --> 00:13:00,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wasn't listening to
the sounds at all.</font>

137
00:13:01,260 --> 00:13:02,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's something other
than the sounds</font>

138
00:13:02,550 --> 00:13:05,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that give away your command patterns,
isn't there?</font>

139
00:13:10,390 --> 00:13:12,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your fingers!</font>

140
00:13:13,060 --> 00:13:14,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be!</font>

141
00:13:14,730 --> 00:13:16,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The movement of the three...</font>

142
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:19,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you saying you memorized
my finger movements and predicted?</font>

143
00:13:21,150 --> 00:13:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way that's possible!</font>

144
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:25,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your right index finger
and ring finger...</font>

145
00:13:33,450 --> 00:13:34,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sound that you make
with those</font>

146
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:37,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">along with the left middle finger
and pinkie,</font>

147
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:40,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that middle crab pincher man
stands ready.</font>

148
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:45,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your right thumb and index finger</font>

149
00:13:45,550 --> 00:13:50,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and your left index finger and pinkie,
the club man charges.</font>

150
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While you were dodging my attacks
and looking for me,</font>

151
00:13:56,690 --> 00:14:01,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was observing each and every one
of your finger moves in detail...</font>

152
00:14:01,230 --> 00:14:06,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">analyzing and memorizing them.</font>

153
00:14:13,990 --> 00:14:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no use...</font>

154
00:14:15,950 --> 00:14:18,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're bound by
Shadow Possession Jutsu.</font>

155
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:24,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The most interesting rule
of the Shogi play is that</font>

156
00:14:25,010 --> 00:14:29,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can use pieces you obtain
as your own pieces.</font>

157
00:14:31,510 --> 00:14:33,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on out...
it's my turn to attack...</font>

158
00:14:33,890 --> 00:14:38,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time I'll hunt you down
using the three pieces.</font>

159
00:14:40,230 --> 00:14:41,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're looking pretty composed.</font>

160
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:44,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stand ready with a kunai knife
at least.</font>

161
00:14:44,610 --> 00:14:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My weapon is just this flute!</font>

162
00:14:47,650 --> 00:14:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you that there hasn't been a person</font>

163
00:14:49,950 --> 00:14:51,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who's heard the sound of
this flute and lived, idiot!</font>

164
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's some confidence!</font>

165
00:14:59,120 --> 00:14:59,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Retreat!</font>

166
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:09,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad you aren't able to
use the pieces, hey!</font>

167
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:15,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, it's my turn!</font>

168
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:20,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

169
00:15:22,350 --> 00:15:24,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu
successful.</font>

170
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you.</font>

171
00:15:42,330 --> 00:15:44,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That I'd hunt you down
using the pieces.</font>

172
00:15:45,670 --> 00:15:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I used the three pieces as bait.</font>

173
00:15:50,130 --> 00:15:53,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In attacking the first hand
is the trick a fake.</font>

174
00:15:54,010 --> 00:15:56,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The basics are to score
with the second hand.</font>

175
00:15:56,890 --> 00:15:57,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bastard...</font>

176
00:16:05,690 --> 00:16:06,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped.</font>

177
00:16:07,020 --> 00:16:09,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that it's come to this
I'll need to force out with power.</font>

178
00:16:10,490 --> 00:16:13,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think that I'd get to
second state in a place like this...</font>

179
00:16:14,530 --> 00:16:15,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It ticks me off but...</font>

180
00:16:15,990 --> 00:16:17,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll acknowledge it.</font>

181
00:16:17,740 --> 00:16:20,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy was pretty impressive trash.</font>

182
00:16:27,420 --> 00:16:29,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is... this?</font>

183
00:16:31,050 --> 00:16:35,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true you're somewhat sharp but...</font>

184
00:16:36,010 --> 00:16:38,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't go as
you've planned from here!</font>

185
00:16:39,010 --> 00:16:40,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

186
00:16:44,350 --> 00:16:48,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is she gonna force herself out
of the Shadow Possession Jutsu?</font>

187
00:16:48,650 --> 00:16:50,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with that tremendous Chakra?</font>

188
00:16:52,950 --> 00:16:54,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Jutsu's gonna come loose!</font>

189
00:16:54,570 --> 00:16:56,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't be worrying about
saving Chakra anymore.</font>

190
00:16:58,660 --> 00:17:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no other way
but to use that Jutsu!</font>

191
00:17:02,700 --> 00:17:05,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Shadow Strangle Jutsu!</font>

192
00:17:12,670 --> 00:17:15,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he grabbing my body
with the shadow?</font>

193
00:17:15,260 --> 00:17:17,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just as if I'm being grabbed
by a real hand...</font>

194
00:17:19,390 --> 00:17:21,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But no more than this!</font>

195
00:17:21,930 --> 00:17:24,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! What incredible strength.</font>

196
00:17:24,390 --> 00:17:26,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this distance
I'll lose to that strength!</font>

197
00:17:27,900 --> 00:17:29,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

198
00:17:29,820 --> 00:17:32,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon Flute: Chains of Fantasia!</font>

199
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad!</font>

200
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this a... Genjutsu?</font>

201
00:17:50,210 --> 00:17:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you aiming?</font>

202
00:18:00,510 --> 00:18:02,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't move my body...</font>

203
00:18:31,670 --> 00:18:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While in second stage,</font>

204
00:18:33,170 --> 00:18:35,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I manipulate many Genjutsu
with my flute.</font>

205
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:40,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of those, this one is
an appropriate for that little rat.</font>

206
00:18:40,220 --> 00:18:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason is...</font>

207
00:18:44,560 --> 00:18:48,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Genjutsu stops the movement
of the prey and ties it up!</font>

208
00:18:51,980 --> 00:18:54,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How's that? How's it feel to
be the one tied up?</font>

209
00:19:01,450 --> 00:19:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this was your last move, huh?
Unfortunately, it's a return checkmate!</font>

210
00:19:08,790 --> 00:19:09,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Little rat!</font>

211
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

212
00:19:20,050 --> 00:19:20,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

213
00:19:21,050 --> 00:19:23,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He broke his own finger
with his own shadow!</font>

214
00:19:24,260 --> 00:19:26,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did he release the Genjutsu
with that pain?</font>

215
00:19:27,020 --> 00:19:29,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of that he kept pretending to
be bound by the Jutsu?!</font>

216
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:35,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you this already</font>

217
00:19:36,020 --> 00:19:38,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that the first hand is the trick
a fake.</font>

218
00:19:38,650 --> 00:19:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The basics are to score
with the second move.</font>

219
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:46,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, this second move...
it's a little different from earlier.</font>

220
00:19:47,410 --> 00:19:48,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With the Shadow Strangle Jutsu</font>

221
00:19:48,700 --> 00:19:54,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the closer in distance you are
to the subject the stronger the hold.</font>

222
00:19:55,130 --> 00:19:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn. I carelessly got too close...</font>

223
00:19:59,090 --> 00:20:00,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not it.</font>

224
00:20:02,630 --> 00:20:06,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The most careless thing was
the words you said earlier</font>

225
00:20:06,260 --> 00:20:08,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"my weapon is just the flute."</font>

226
00:20:09,890 --> 00:20:11,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're looking pretty composed.</font>

227
00:20:12,140 --> 00:20:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stand ready with a kunai knife at least.</font>

228
00:20:14,310 --> 00:20:16,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My weapon is just this flute!</font>

229
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:19,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you that
there hasn't been a person</font>

230
00:20:19,280 --> 00:20:21,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who's heard the sound of this flute
and lived, idiot!</font>

231
00:20:22,490 --> 00:20:23,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

232
00:20:24,530 --> 00:20:25,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

233
00:20:25,910 --> 00:20:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason I threw the kunai knife
