278
00:22:39,120 --> 00:22:41,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Am I having a dream or something?!</font>

279
00:22:41,590 --> 00:22:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But it's too intense to be a dream!</font>

280
00:22:45,050 --> 00:22:48,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">That suit with its outstanding
ventilation and supple fit.</font>

281
00:22:48,170 --> 00:22:50,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">On top of that, those eyes,
that hair, those eyebrows!</font>

282
00:22:50,890 --> 00:22:55,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You! Why are you here...?!</font>

283
00:22:56,100 --> 00:22:59,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Konoha's Green Beast Attacks!"</font>

284
00:22:59,480 --> 00:23:01,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I sense the approach of a storm!</font>

